# Local development config for Transpondarr.
#
# Copy to `.env` (which is gitignored) — `make dev` / the server loads it on
# startup. Real environment variables always override these, and anything set
# here is optional. Integration values are also editable at runtime in the
# Settings UI (those DB overrides take precedence over these).

# Bootstrap the web-UI admin account so dev doesn't stop at the setup screen.
# TRANSPONDARR_AUTH_USERNAME=dev
# TRANSPONDARR_AUTH_PASSWORD=dev
# Skip login for local/private addresses (handy in dev): enabled | local
# TRANSPONDARR_AUTH_REQUIRED=local

# A fixed machine API key (X-Api-Key) so curl/scripts are easy. If unset, the
# server generates one on first run and persists it in the database.
# TRANSPONDARR_API_KEY=dev-local-key

# SQLite DB file path (defaults to <DATA_DIR>/transpondarr.db)
# TRANSPONDARR_DB=./data/transpondarr.db

# qBittorrent download client (unset ⇒ no download client)
# TRANSPONDARR_QBIT_URL=http://localhost:8080
# TRANSPONDARR_QBIT_USER=admin
# TRANSPONDARR_QBIT_PASSWORD=adminadmin

# Torznab indexer — Prowlarr aggregate feed or Jackett (unset ⇒ no indexer)
# TRANSPONDARR_TORZNAB_URL=http://localhost:9696/1/api
# TRANSPONDARR_TORZNAB_APIKEY=

# Library import target (unset ⇒ import disabled)
# TRANSPONDARR_LIBRARY_DIR=./data/library
# TRANSPONDARR_IMPORT_MODE=auto
